  "title": "Reform UK Leader Faces Backlash Over Climate Misconduct and Heat Wave",
  "summary": "Nigel Farage and Reform UK leader Richard Tice faced criticism after being accused of spreading misinformation over their role in the climate crisis, while urging people to enjoy the heatwaves. The investigation aims to determine if their policies align with transparency and party values.",
